===Adjective===
{{head|en|superlative adjective}}

# {{en-superlative of|old}}; [[greatest]] in [[age]] or [[seniority]].
#: '''''eldest''' son''

====Usage notes====
The normal superlative of ''old'' is {{m|en|oldest}}. The form ''eldest'' usually refers to relations with respect to seniority in age.

